  unitName: Lava
  unitId: 10122
  unitNumber: 153
  description: An elite swordswoman from a top-secret project in the ruined Agni
    Empire. She was given harsh training from birth to make her the ultimate warrior.
    She was ranked highest in her order by age 14. Alas, as she was raised this way,
    she developed personality issues. She communicated only through commands which
    further distanced her from others.
  summonDesc: You need my blade?<br>Promise me I'll face the<br>strongest and it's
    yours.
  fusionDesc: My value is my strength.<br>Therefore, I need to become<br>stronger.
